  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_01",
      "hash64": "04DCA3FBE2124FD0",
      "text": "Attention ! Je te conseille de garder\\ntes distances... Je suis dangereux... !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_02",
      "hash64": "04DCA6FBE21254E9",
      "text": "Laisse-moi seul... Ça vaut mieux pour toi...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_03",
      "hash64": "04DCA5FBE2125336",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_04",
      "hash64": "04DCA8FBE212584F",
      "text": "Attends... Mais, alors...\\nToi aussi... ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_05",
      "hash64": "04DCA7FBE212569C",
      "text": "Toi aussi, t’as entendu une « voix »... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_06",
      "hash64": "04DCAAFBE2125BB5",
      "text": "Je vois...\\nQuelle voix t’a guidé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e jusqu’à présent... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_01",
      "hash64": "2C3001979E4B352C",
      "text": "Celle de la lumière... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_02",
      "hash64": "2C3004979E4B3A45",
      "text": "Celle du vent... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_03",
      "hash64": "2C3003979E4B3892",
      "text": "Celle des ténèbres... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_04",
      "hash64": "2C2FFE979E4B3013",
      "text": "Celle du hasard... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_05",
      "hash64": "2C2FFD979E4B2E60",
      "text": "Je ne sais pas.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_07",
      "hash64": "04DCA9FBE2125A02",
      "text": "La voix de la lumière ? Hmpfff...\\nMais t’es un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e normie, en fait... !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_08",
      "hash64": "04DCACFBE2125F1B",
      "text": "Comment ? La voix du vent, tu dis... ?\\nAh ouais, j’avoue, j’y avais pas pensé... !\\c\\nOuais... C’est stylé... !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_09",
      "hash64": "04DCABFBE2125D68",
      "text": "Les ténèbres, hein... ? Hé hé, c’est parfait...\\nTon cœur aussi se débat dans l’obscurité épaisse\\r\\net impénétrable du monde qui nous entoure...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_10",
      "hash64": "04D93EFBE20F6E5A",
      "text": "Le hasard n’existe pas. C’est une réponse\\nde normie, ça ! Fais un effort !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_11",
      "hash64": "04D93FFBE20F700D",
      "text": "On se ressemble... J’en déduis donc\\nque le monde te fait souffrir, toi aussi...\\r\\nEt que cette souffrance se localise dans ta main...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_06",
      "hash64": "2C3000979E4B3379",
      "text": "Droite ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_07",
      "hash64": "2C2FFF979E4B31C6",
      "text": "Gauche ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_12",
      "hash64": "04D93CFBE20F6AF4",
      "text": "Ta main droite ? Euh... C’est gênant, là.\\nJ’ai dû me tromper sur ton compte...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_13",
      "hash64": "04D93DFBE20F6CA7",
      "text": "Oui ! Dans ta main gauche, c’est ça !\\nJ’en attendais pas moins de toi...\\c\\nÇa fait de nous des camarades dans ce monde\\nrongé par la douleur... !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_14",
      "hash64": "04D93AFBE20F678E",
      "text": "Pour montrer notre lien, je vais te marquer\\ndu sceau du crépuscule.\\c\\nEt je vais aussi t’enseigner la façon de montrer\\nta douleur au monde entier.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_system_01",
      "hash64": "340BF1E47E73D21E",
      "text": "Le jeune garçon vous a appris la réaction\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Ô main gauche, ô ténèbres[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_npc",
      "hash64": "C1792A01F38D539A",
      "text": "Ô Camarade !\\nRésiste...\\c\\nJe sais comme les ténèbres et la douleur sont\\ntentantes, mais les laisse pas t’engloutir... !!!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
